["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年產1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特：賣的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年產僅1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特。秘訣在於同時擁有奢侈品的排他性和運動隊的包容性，用稀缺性製造神話，用社群維持忠誠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然選擇創始人Tristan聊，Elys、賽博分身、靈魂、Context的獲取與流動和AI社交網絡 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交網絡要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 認為 AI 時代唯一重要的事是構建主體性——把 context 沉澱下來，讓 AI 替你做社交裡最無聊的商增，人只接管最重要的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"崔健×羅永浩！去天堂和去地獄，都要帶上藝術家 Trap Live House\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-04-02-cn2d7912-崔健-向资本妥协这一步-迈出去就再收不回来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1fdd6a22cb43a191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0402</span></div>\n<h2>崔健：向資本妥協這一步，邁出去就再收不回來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說音樂人一旦為了賺錢向市場讓一步，社交、人脈、習慣就會全都被拖向那個方向、再也收不回頭——這是他拒絕官方現場專輯、拒絕一比一復刻老歌的真正邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">搖滾樂</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與音樂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"134. 【數據的綜述】和謝晨聊，新時代的石油、歷史、版圖、數據金字塔、定價與Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d3e6746f1dd5fb6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套數據閉環，在機器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多數據，是因為它部署了最多自己的車，靠的是本體。但具身領域沒有上百萬臺機器人，最多的數據必然來自仿真和人的第一視角，本體商當不成最好的大腦商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"楊笠×羅永浩！不想成為“靶心”，也無意成為“燈塔”\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-26-cn2d7912-杨笠爆红风波溯源-那年男演员几乎都在刻板调侃老婆女友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/156b41be41c646a8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0326</span></div>\n<h2>楊笠爆紅風波溯源：那年男演員幾乎都在刻板調侃老婆女友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2021年脫口秀舞臺上，多數男演員調侃老婆女友全是陳詞濫調，這是楊笠那次表演被罵得最兇、卻也最被誤讀的真實背景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脫口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡輿論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"133. 對謝賽寧的7小時馬拉松訪談：世界模型、逃出硅谷、AMI Labs、兩次拒絕Ilya、楊立昆、李飛飛和42 research taste representation learning contrastive learning anti-fragile DiT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-16-zhangxiaojun-世界模型不是语言模型-谢赛宁说lm终将凋零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4818fadeef8d1188-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">6:45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是語言模型：謝賽寧說LM終將凋零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">謝賽寧認為語言模型是很好的工具，但不是通用智能的地基——它終將凋零。真正的地基是視覺與表徵學習，這也是他離開硅谷、和楊立昆創立AMI的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">表徵學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"戲劇導演孟京輝×羅永浩！從“愛惹事的反叛者”，到戲劇烏托邦的建構者 Theatre of the Absurd Stanislavski system\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-03-05-cn2d7912-先锋戏剧票房悖论-越先锋-观众反而越多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/11d3f2d6cb063d7a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:20:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0305</span></div>\n<h2>先鋒戲劇票房悖論：越先鋒，觀眾反而越多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他不靠專家評審或打廣告，直接把先鋒戲劇講給年輕觀眾聽，三十年過去這些戲沒有冷場，《戀愛的犀牛》甚至演到了第十一代演員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">先鋒戲劇</span><span class=\"tag\">內容創作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“不開玩笑” × 羅永浩的X字路口！折騰未必會贏，但不折騰一定會後悔 ADHD 專注達\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-28-cn2d7912-罗永浩-人应该终生不退休-财富自由的朋友99-撑不过半年就复出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5d4d85d51d7f33f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:23:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0228</span></div>\n<h2>羅永浩：人應該終生不退休，財富自由的朋友99%撐不過半年就復出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說這個判斷不是空想，而是觀察移動互聯網十年裡，身邊一大批實現財富自由、發誓要躺平的朋友，幾乎全都撐不過三到六個月又出來折騰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅永浩</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP2 曾燕紅：從中學老師到打破速登珠峰世界紀錄，我唯一不能做的就是放棄 PTSD Free Solo Aim High, Achieve High\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-27-xiaotianzhang-离破纪录仅剩90米-她却选择带队原路撤退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d38949a273cb9e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0227</span></div>\n<h2>離破紀錄僅剩90米，她卻選擇帶隊原路撤退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整個團隊已經把消息傳了出去，只剩90米就能刷新珠峰速攀世界紀錄，Ada卻和夏爾巴一起決定下撤——理由是哪怕只有百分之一的風險，她都不願意冒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">珠峰速攀</span><span class=\"tag\">風險決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代碼比交人更可能合作，但協調極難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡讓雙方互讀源代碼，用 Löb 定理實現合作；但合作依賴幾乎相同的代碼或共享隨機數，現實中協調成本極高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 產權，是為了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 擁有產權，它們就更不願意破壞產權制度本身——包括搶走人類全部財產。這不是道德關懷，是風險對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 對星海圖創始人高繼揚的3小時訪談：鯰魚、曾國藩、Waymo與Momenta的兩面、一隻狼與許華哲的離開 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>機器人行業不浪漫：鏈條太長，人得把頭伸到土裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海圖創始人高繼揚說，機器人創業的競爭是六邊形：整機、供應鏈、數據、模型、渠道、終端，算法傳播週期只有兩三個月，壁壘最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"音樂人張瑋瑋×羅永浩！我們都是那個“混亂又偉大”的 90 年代的倖存者 after party\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-11-cn2d7912-舒适环境里创作不出东西-冲突和差异越大反而越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0980c89abd69e75d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">5:39:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0211</span></div>\n<h2>舒適環境裡創作不出東西，衝突和差異越大反而越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民謠樂手張瑋瑋回顧從西北廠礦小城到北京地下室排練的十幾年：父母離婚、國企崩塌、廣州捱餓賣唱、樂隊解散，每一次動盪都沒把他壓垮，反而是後來生活安穩下來才真正寫不出東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民謠</span><span class=\"tag\">90年代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"蔣奇明&amp;雙雪濤×羅永浩！如何成為飛行家 Peaky Blinders\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-04-cn2d7912-看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后-罗永浩的悲观被打消了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8991b069d150d3a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>看過深圳年輕人的硬件樣機後，羅永浩的悲觀被打消了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這兩年大環境常讓羅永浩悲觀，但去深圳看了一圈20歲出頭的硬件創業者、看到已經打出來的樣機後，他相信紮實的工業基礎能托住下一代，重新樂觀起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東北文藝復興</span><span class=\"tag\">電影改編</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任階躍星辰董事長的訪談：聰明人的誘惑、取捨、超長鏈路殘酷淘汰賽、階躍函數和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任階躍星辰董事長：基模公司做2B和純2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少燒30億人民幣、要維持三到五年，所以做2B或純C端軟件都算不過賬；階躍的賭注是基模加終端，用軟硬一體換一張上牌桌的資格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"130. 張月光創業兩年首次訪談：妙鴨不是AI Native產品、流程到上下文設計、One Way Door和乙女遊戲 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鴨不是 AI Native 產品：它只是把 AI 用好的互聯網產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張月光復盤兩年創業：妙鴨靠限制用戶自由度換取穩定效果，本質是互聯網產品思維；AI Native 產品要換成面向 context 的設計，而單向門產品才是他願意押上全部身家的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 產品</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"劉震雲×羅永浩！有些玩笑含著淚也要開完\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-15-cn2d7912-乡村不是没有天才-而是天才没赶上恢复高考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5efb79bd917b306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0115</span></div>\n<h2>鄉村不是沒有天才，而是天才沒趕上恢復高考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果不是恢復高考，劉震雲現在還在種地；他那位邊種地邊解微積分的表哥，很可能本該拿物理諾貝爾獎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文學創作</span><span class=\"tag\">鄉土中國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP1 劉嘉玲說，60歲是她的黃金時代\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-13-xiaotianzhang-趁体力还在-刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2805c831609a7cd9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0113</span></div>\n<h2>趁體力還在：劉嘉玲說60到70歲才是她的黃金時代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她說70歲後體力撐不住旅行與應酬，60到70歲反而是情緒最穩定、最該趁現在去埃及、耶路撒冷這些心願地的十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衰老心態</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻相處</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lovart 創始人陳冕×羅永浩！且讓我大鬧一場，然後悄然離去 AI native reward model AGI Agent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-09-cn2d7912-ai十年内不会让人类没用-这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21e3cf477d7561e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>AI十年內不會讓人類沒用：這是陳冕押上全部身家的賭注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI十年內學不會人類的品味和判斷，像Lovart這樣需要人介入的設計產品就還有價值；一旦判斷錯，公司也會跟著完蛋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">產品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市訪談，和智譜CEO張鵬聊：敢問路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，張鵬說中國 AI 沒有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資本市場可能有泡沫，中國不存在——中國投 AI 的錢只有美國的二十幾分之一，遠遠不夠。張鵬的邏輯是：離 AGI 還遠、錢還不夠，就更得投，不投它不會自然發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"128. Manus決定出售前最後的訪談：啊，這奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 決定出售前最後訪談：AI 沒有蠻荒期，因為沒新平臺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移動互聯網的蠻荒期來自硬件換代，桌面到手機讓巨頭和個人開發者眾生平等；AI 技術突破更大，卻沒有出現全新平臺，所以巨頭、創業公司、個人開發者反應一樣快，蠻荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影石Insta360 創始人劉靖康×羅永浩！比生存更重要的是那些微小的念頭 337 Investigation NPE PMF DFM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-25-cn2d7912-硬刚大疆做无人机-他们图的不是打败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/096fe60475239ebc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1225</span></div>\n<h2>硬剛大疆做無人機，他們圖的不是打敗對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消費級無人機此前幾乎全軍覆沒，他們明知如此仍進場，理由不是搶市場，而是做無人機能一次性把公司的技術、製造、供應鏈能力拉到新臺階，幫企業穿越下一個週期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件創業</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季報跨年對談：和廣密預言一場AI War、兩大聯盟和第三個範式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨頭砸光最後一分錢也不下牌桌的戰爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 泡沫，是拿商業回報算出來的賬；巨頭把它當成新的國防或核武器，算的是被顛覆的風險——所以寧可砸光最後一分錢，也不輕易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"126. 和紅杉鄭慶生聊：經濟史的流量革命、人類行為模式的不可預期，與創始人性格 雙邊網絡效應 PMF 倖存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的網絡沒有自然壟斷，邊際成本不趨近於零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網產品是巨大的城鎮，邊際成本趨近於零所以贏家通吃；AI 每多一個用戶就多一份 token 成本，這個差別會改寫流量節點的商業設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>"]